{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/logo_strona_07.png?t=1667828695\" /><br><strong>Box Kid Adventures</strong> is a dynamic, top-down puzzle game.<br>You play as Box Kid \u2013 a toy made of cardboard \u2013 going through various levels, full of nasty enemies and brain challenging puzzles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/story_05.png?t=1667828695\" /><br><i>&quot;In the age of electronics, the toy-robots became kids favourite playthings. However, a young, ambitious designer, created a new toy. A Kid. A Box Kid! A toy made out of cardboard. A toy that should breathe life into the world of imagination. But the company's CEO wasn't impressed by that idea and he threw Box Kid into the garbage chute... But was that the real reason? Unveil the truth, as you help Box Kid discover his destiny!&quot;</i><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/featu_09.png?t=1667828695\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPERIENCE...</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/experience_02.gif?t=1667828695\" /><br>...simple but deep gameplay, that really captures the spirit of the 8-bit era.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENJOY...</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/enjoy_08.gif?t=1667828695\" /><br>...beautiful, cartoon graphics in Hi-Definition.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GO TROUGH...</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/levels_08.gif?t=1667828695\" /><br>...75 various levels, full of nasty enemies and brain challenging puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CREATE AND SHARE...</strong></h2><